# Patterns to ignore when building Helm packages.
# Keeps the packaged chart (and therefore every stored Helm release object)
# down to what templates actually need at render time - this repo is a
# monorepo of site docs/scripts alongside the chart, and bundling all of it
# into every release's stored Secret is what pushed a real release
# ("epik8s-platform" in namespace "langfuse") past etcd's 1MiB Secret limit,
# blocking further `helm upgrade` entirely. See README.md "Verification".
.git/
.gitignore
.helmignore
*.md
docs/
tests/
# Local-only helper scripts, never referenced by any template via .Files.*.
secrets-k8sda/
BALTIG_LNF_CONTROL_AGO26.txt
# Reference-only overlay files, always passed via `helm ... -f <file>` from
# the CLI - never read from inside a template via .Files.*, so they don't
# need to travel inside the packaged chart archive itself.
values-domain-*.yaml
values-generic.yaml
